Author: Goga
CreatedAt: 10/09/26
Description: |
  The failure taxonomy of prettyplay: product defect, incurable step, LLM infrastructure, compliance verdict — mutations of one library base — the shared verdict of a terminal failure, and the single structured render of its message.
